WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.020
stared at the river.

2
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.681
"I should have stopped Master from getting in that canoe.

3
00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:23.362
But whenever I warn him about someone, he doesn't believe me."

4
00:00:24.263 --> 00:00:25.143
Wujing nodded.

5
00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:28.204
"I'll find out where that man took our friends."

6
00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:31.749
purple spirit dived into the river.

7
00:00:36.311 --> 00:00:38.772
He soon came to a palace.

8
00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:43.514
A sign on the gate read "Home of the Black River God."

9
00:00:44.374 --> 00:00:46.495
Wujing tapped on the door with his spear.

10
00:00:46.515 --> 00:00:48.015
"Open up!"

11
00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:51.617
The door opened, and a lizard peeked out.

12
00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:54.198
"What do you want?"

13
00:00:54.698 --> 00:00:55.418
asked the lizard.

14
00:00:55.438 --> 00:01:00.176
"I'm looking for my companions," said Wujing.

15
00:01:00.377 --> 00:01:01.938
is a monk, and the other is a pig.

16
00:01:02.678 --> 00:01:04.160
They were kidnapped by a man."

17
00:01:05.561 --> 00:01:08.884
"They were kidnapped by me," said the lizard.

18
00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:11.546
"You?" said Wujing.

19
00:01:14.188 --> 00:01:15.269
The lizard smiled.

20
00:01:15.289 --> 00:01:21.634
"I plan to eat the Tang Monk and live forever!"

21
00:01:21.774 --> 00:01:24.036
Wujing struck at the lizard with his spear.

22
00:01:24.837 --> 00:01:28.060
The lizard spun around, blocking the spear with his tail.

23
00:01:29.312 --> 00:01:31.493
The force nearly knocked Wujing over.

24
00:01:32.354 --> 00:01:34.455
Right away the lizard was on top of him.

25
00:01:36.016 --> 00:01:36.576
off me!"

26
00:01:36.856 --> 00:01:37.717
shouted Wujing.

27
00:01:38.417 --> 00:01:39.458
He shoved the lizard.

28
00:01:41.719 --> 00:01:42.800
lizard attacked again.

29
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.442
Wujing swung his spear and then swam upward.

30
00:01:48.223 --> 00:01:51.885
He splashed out of the river and landed next to Wukong.

31
00:01:51.905 --> 00:01:57.368
"There's a lizard demon down there," said Wujing, breathing heavily.

32
00:01:58.896 --> 00:02:00.337
"He's very powerful."

33
00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:04.919
Wukong was about to respond when he noticed someone nearby.

34
00:02:05.819 --> 00:02:08.300
The man from the canoe was walking toward them.

35
00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:11.542
monkey pulled out his iron bar.

36
00:02:11.562 --> 00:02:14.423
"How dare you kidnap our friends!"

37
00:02:15.563 --> 00:02:17.404
man fell to his knees, shaking.

38
00:02:17.424 --> 00:02:19.025
"It wasn't me!"

39
00:02:19.345 --> 00:02:19.865
he cried.

40
00:02:21.626 --> 00:02:22.747
was a lizard demon.

41
00:02:23.527 --> 00:02:26.768
I'm the Black River God, and this is my river.

42
00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:28.629
But that lizard pretended he was me!"

43
00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.492
Wukong put the iron bar back in his ear.

44
00:02:33.793 --> 00:02:35.014
believe you," he said.

45
00:02:35.034 --> 00:02:37.095
"Do you know who the lizard is?"

46
00:02:38.736 --> 00:02:40.257
don't," said the river god.

47
00:02:40.777 --> 00:02:42.639
He looked even more frightened now.

48
00:02:43.559 --> 00:02:46.821
"But his uncle is the mighty Dragon King of the Eastern Sea."

49
00:02:48.342 --> 00:02:49.283
Wukong laughed.

50
00:02:50.404 --> 00:02:52.285
"That dragon is a friend of mine.

51
00:02:53.346 --> 00:02:54.527
also a bit scared of me.

52
00:02:55.287 --> 00:03:03.248
I'll go have a talk with him."

53
00:03:03.328 --> 00:03:06.469
A moment later the monkey was at the Dragon King's palace.

54
00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:10.910
again, Wukong," said the dragon, smiling.

55
00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:12.991
"What can I do for you?"

56
00:03:13.071 --> 00:03:16.992
"Why did you let your nephew take over the Black River?"

57
00:03:17.192 --> 00:03:18.112
demanded the monkey.

58
00:03:19.633 --> 00:03:21.133
dragon's smile faded.

59
00:03:21.153 --> 00:03:22.954
"What are you talking about?"

60
00:03:24.154 --> 00:03:28.555
"Your nephew—a lizard demon—took over the Black River," said Wukong.

61
00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:31.336
"And now he's planning to eat the Tang Monk."

62
00:03:33.024 --> 00:03:34.345
dear," said the dragon.

63
00:03:34.365 --> 00:03:36.247
"I had no idea.

64
00:03:37.188 --> 00:03:38.248
I'll take care of it."

65
00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.892
Wukong and the dragon flew back to the Black River.

66
00:03:44.113 --> 00:03:46.895
The Dragon King shouted, "Nephew!

67
00:03:47.235 --> 00:03:51.818
Come out of that river at once!"

68
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.360
The lizard leaped from the river.

69
00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.362
"Uncle!" he said.

70
00:03:56.382 --> 00:03:59.164
"It's nice of you to visit."

71
00:04:00.608 --> 00:04:01.749
"I'm not here to visit!"

72
00:04:02.009 --> 00:04:02.810
yelled the dragon.

73
00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.612
here to take you to the Jade Emperor.

74
00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.493
You will be punished."

75
00:04:09.655 --> 00:04:10.535
The lizard gulped.

76
00:04:11.256 --> 00:04:15.078
His head hanging low, he followed his uncle up into the sky.

77
00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:19.361
With a splash, the river god appeared from the water.

78
00:04:20.602 --> 00:04:22.924
The Tang Monk and Bajie were with him.

79
00:04:22.944 --> 00:04:25.786
"Thank you, Wukong," said the god.

80
00:04:25.806 --> 00:04:28.428
"You're welcome," said the monkey.

81
00:04:29.684 --> 00:04:31.506
"But we still need to cross your river."

82
00:04:33.448 --> 00:04:34.850
easy," said the river god.

83
00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:36.611
He held up his hand.

84
00:04:38.213 --> 00:04:42.137
Instantly the river stopped flowing, and the water formed walls.

85
00:04:44.339 --> 00:04:48.424
The travelers walked across the muddy riverbed and continued west.
